  "cards": [
    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B05c scope (workflows)","items":["Completes B05-agent-workflow. Modules: workflows (15/4), workflow-definition (22/1), workflow-assignment (5/1), workflow-invariant-rule (5/1), workflow-node (1/1), workflow-run (5/1), workflow-sandbox-run (4/1), workflow-test-fixture (5/1) = 62 routes / 11 controllers.","Config admin: definitions, assignments, nodes, invariant rules, test fixtures. Runs: admin workflow-runs, run traces, sandbox runs. Facade/runtime: /workflows and consultation workflow runs. Hooks: /hooks/workflows callbacks.","Workflow-run-trace controller shares /admin/workflow-runs base with workflow-run controller (separate controllers)."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Workflow definition/config: admin CRUD/publish/webhook-secret DTOs -> definition/assignment/rule/fixture records (verify exact routes, versioning, and secret handling).","Workflow run/sandbox: create/list/get run or sandbox-run requests -> run/trace/sandbox state; sandbox runs are scoped to definitionId in path.","Facade/consultation runs: /workflows and /consultations/:consultationId/workflows requests -> workflow discovery/run orchestration responses (verify service wiring).","Hooks: POST /hooks/workflows callback payloads -> hook handling/result (auth/signature verification is implementation-specific). Verify exact DTOs and hook security."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence and limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controller/service sources verified in local tree.","Downstreams: workflow config/run data store (Postgres/Prisma). Workflow execution may involve Temporal/harness/sandbox runtime and hook callers — summarized as workflow engine/runtime.","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes (62 routes/11 controllers); WorkflowNodeService and some workflows-facade service names not separately verified; reconcile route/DTO/hook auth/versioning semantics with OpenAPI/implementation."]}
  ]
